# # Box model
# The W3C standard box model is shown below; IE's quirks-mode box model is not covered
# +-----------------------------------------------------------+
# |                          margin                           |
# |  +-----------------------------------------------------+  |
# |  |            (black line) border                      |  |
# |  |  +-----------------------------------------------+  |  |
# |  |  |                    padding                    |  |  |
# |  |  |  +-----------------------------------------+  |  |  |
# |  |  |  |               📝 Text content           |  |  |  |
# |  |  |  |               (content)                 |  |  |  |
# |  |  |  |         background-color: #e6f7ff;      |  |  |  |
# |  |  |  |  background covers only content+padding |  |  |  |
# |  |  |  +-----------------------------------------+  |  |  |
# |  |  |                                               |  |  |
# |  |  +-----------------------------------------------+  |  |
# |  |                                                     |  |
# +--+-----------------------------------------------------+--+
# 
# ←─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────→
#               Total element width =
# margin + border + padding + content + padding + border + margin
# 
# | Feature                                 | Property                   | Example                 |
# |-----------------------------------------+----------------------------+-------------------------|
# | Set size                                | width, height              | width: 300px;           |
# | Padding (padding-top/right/bottom/left) | padding: 10px 20px;        |                         |
# | Border (border-width/style/color)       | border: 2px solid #ccc;    |                         |
# | Margin (margin-top/right/bottom/left)   | margin: 0 auto; (centered) |                         |
# | Switch model                            | box-sizing                 | box-sizing: border-box; |
#
# box-sizing
#
# Difference between box-sizing: content-box and border-box
#
#  ╔══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
#  ║                       What width/height includes                             ║
#  ╠══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╣
#  ║                                                                              ║
#  ║  content-box (default)                                                       ║
#  ║  ┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐  ║
#  ║  │  width/height includes:     [✓ content]                                │  ║
#  ║  │  width/height excludes:     [✗ padding] [✗ border] [✗ margin]          │  ║
#  ║  └────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘  ║
#  ║                                                                              ║
#  ║  border-box (recommended)                                                    ║
#  ║  ┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐  ║
#  ║  │  width/height includes:     [✓ content] [✓ padding] [✓ border]         │  ║
#  ║  │  width/height excludes:     [✗ margin]                                 │  ║
#  ║  └────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘  ║
#  ║                                                                              ║
#  ║  How margin is handled (same for both)                                       ║
#  ║  ┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐  ║
#  ║  │  Whichever box-sizing is used, margin is never included in             │  ║
#  ║  │  width/height; it is always extra outer spacing                        │  ║
#  ║  └────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┘  ║
#  ║                                                                              ║
#  ╚══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╝
#
# ## Inline element box model
# 
# For inline elements the box model fully applies horizontally; vertically, padding and border are
# displayed but don't push surrounding elements away, and margin has no effect at all.
#  | Property     | Horizontal                     | Vertical                       |
#  |--------------+--------------------------------+--------------------------------|
#  | margin       | ✅ Applies and pushes elements | ❌ No effect at all            |
#  | border       | ✅ Applies and pushes elements | ⚠  Shown but overlaps elements |
#  | padding      | ✅ Applies and pushes elements | ⚠  Shown but overlaps elements |
#  | width/height | ❌ No effect                   | ❌ No effect                   |
#
# Overlap ≠ push: vertical padding and border are displayed and may cover the content of adjacent
# elements, but they don't change the position of adjacent elements.
#
# Use `display: inline-block` to get some block-level behavior:
# - width and height properties take effect.
# - padding, margin and border push other elements away.
# However, it doesn't break onto a new line, and only becomes larger than its content when width and
# height are set explicitly.
#
# # Layout
#
# ## float
#
# float takes an element out of the normal document flow and moves it left or right until it hits
# the container edge or another floated element.
#
# ┌────────────────────┬────────────────────────┬────────┬────────────────────┬────────────────────┐
# │ Property/trait     │ Value/description      │ Out of │ Typical use/effect │ Source             │
# │                    │                        │ flow   │                    │                    │
# ├────────────────────┼────────────────────────┼────────┼────────────────────┼────────────────────┤
# │ float: left        │ Float left             │ ✅     │ Left-aligned       │ CSS 2.1 spec       │
# │                    │                        │        │ images, left       │                    │
# │                    │                        │        │ sidebar            │                    │
# ├────────────────────┼────────────────────────┼────────┼────────────────────┼────────────────────┤
# │ float: right       │ Float right            │ ✅     │ Right-aligned      │ CSS 2.1 spec       │
# │                    │                        │        │ images, right      │                    │
# │                    │                        │        │ sidebar            │                    │
# ├────────────────────┼────────────────────────┼────────┼────────────────────┼────────────────────┤
# │ float: none        │ No float (default)     │ ❌     │ Normal document    │ CSS 2.1 spec       │
# │                    │                        │        │ flow               │                    │
# ├────────────────────┼────────────────────────┼────────┼────────────────────┼────────────────────┤
# │ float:inherit      │ Inherit the parent's   │ -      │ Rarely used        │ CSS 2.1 spec       │
# │                    │ value                  │        │                    │                    │
# ├────────────────────┼────────────────────────┼────────┼────────────────────┼────────────────────┤
# │ clear: left        │ No floats allowed on   │ -      │ Applied to         │ CSS 2.1 spec       │
# │                    │ the left               │        │ following elements │                    │
# ├────────────────────┼────────────────────────┼────────┼────────────────────┼────────────────────┤
# │ clear: right       │ No floats allowed on   │ -      │ Applied to         │ CSS 2.1 spec       │
# │                    │ the right              │        │ following elements │                    │
# ├────────────────────┼────────────────────────┼────────┼────────────────────┼────────────────────┤
# │ clear: both        │ No floats allowed on   │ -      │ Applied to         │ CSS 2.1 spec       │
# │                    │ either side            │        │ following elements │                    │
# │                    │                        │        │ (most common)      │                    │
# ├────────────────────┼────────────────────────┼────────┼────────────────────┼────────────────────┤
# │ Out of flow        │ Takes up no normal     │ ✅     │ Parent container   │ CSS spec/browser   │
# │                    │ space                  │        │ height collapses   │ behavior           │
# ├────────────────────┼────────────────────────┼────────┼────────────────────┼────────────────────┤
# │ Text wrapping      │ Inline elements wrap   │ -      │ Mixed text and     │ CSS spec/browser   │
# │                    │ around floats          │        │ images             │ behavior           │
# ├────────────────────┼────────────────────────┼────────┼────────────────────┼────────────────────┤
# │ Becomes block      │ Becomes a block        │ -      │ Width/height can   │ CSS spec           │
# │                    │ element when floated   │        │ be set, display    │                    │
# │                    │                        │        │ has no effect      │                    │
# ├────────────────────┼────────────────────────┼────────┼────────────────────┼────────────────────┤
# │ Horizontal flow    │ Same-direction floats  │ -      │ Navigation menus   │ CSS spec/browser   │
# │                    │ line up in order       │        │                    │ behavior           │
# ├────────────────────┼────────────────────────┼────────┼────────────────────┼────────────────────┤
# │ Empty-tag clearfix │ <div style="clear:bot  │ -      │ Simple but adds    │ Developer practice │
# │                    │ h"></div>              │        │ useless tags       │                    │
# ├────────────────────┼────────────────────────┼────────┼────────────────────┼────────────────────┤
# │ overflow clearfix  │ overflow: hidden/auto  │ -      │ One line, but may  │ Developer practice │
# │                    │                        │        │ hide content       │                    │
# ├────────────────────┼────────────────────────┼────────┼────────────────────┼────────────────────┤
# │ ::after clearfix   │ .clearfix::after {     │ -      │ Standard approach, │ Developer practice │
# │                    │ content: ""; display:  │        │ needs an extra     │                    │
# │                    │ table; clear: both;    │        │ class              │                    │
# │                    │ }                      │        │                    │                    │
# ├────────────────────┼────────────────────────┼────────┼────────────────────┼────────────────────┤
# │ flow-root clearfix │ display: flow-root     │ -      │ Modern and         │ CSS 3 spec         │
# │                    │                        │        │ concise, not       │                    │
# │                    │                        │        │ supported          │                    │
# │                    │                        │        │ by old browsers    │                    │
# ├────────────────────┼────────────────────────┼────────┼────────────────────┼────────────────────┤
# │ Flexbox layout     │ 1D layout              │ ❌     │ Replaces float for │ CSS 3 spec         │
# │                    │                        │        │ layout             │                    │
# ├────────────────────┼────────────────────────┼────────┼────────────────────┼────────────────────┤
# │ Grid layout        │ 2D layout              │ ❌     │ Replaces float for │ CSS 3 spec         │
# │                    │                        │        │ layout             │                    │
# └────────────────────┴────────────────────────┴────────┴────────────────────┴────────────────────┘
#
# Effect of a left-floated image (float: left)
#   ┌─────────────────────────────┐
#   │ ┌───────┐  Floated image    │
#   │ │ Image │  example: this    │
#   │ │       │  sample text      │
#   │ └───────┘  shows the effect │
#   │                             │
#   │ The second paragraph goes   │
#   │ below the image...          │
#   └─────────────────────────────┘
#
# ## position (positioning)
#
#
#  position 
#  ├── static: default, not positioned
#  ├── relative: offset from its own original position, often used as the positioned parent
#  ├── absolute: relative to the positioned ancestor, removed from the document flow
#  ├── fixed: relative to the viewport, always fixed
#  └── sticky: sticks while scrolling, the modern approach
#
#  Used with: top/right/bottom/left + z-index
#
#
#  ┌──────────┬─────────────────────┬────────────────────────────────┬─────────────────────────────┐
#  │ Property │ Value               │ Description                    │ Example                     │
#  ├──────────┼─────────────────────┼────────────────────────────────┼─────────────────────────────┤
#  │ position │ static              │ Default, normal document flow, │ position: static;           │
#  │          │                     │ not positioned                 │                             │
#  ├──────────┼─────────────────────┼────────────────────────────────┼─────────────────────────────┤
#  │ position │ relative            │ Offset from its own original   │ position: relative; top:    │
#  │          │                     │ position, stays in the         │ 10px; left: 20px;           │
#  │          │                     │ document flow                  │                             │
#  ├──────────┼─────────────────────┼────────────────────────────────┼─────────────────────────────┤
#  │ position │ absolute            │ Relative to the nearest        │ position: absolute; top: 0; │
#  │          │                     │ positioned ancestor, removed   │ right: 0;                   │
#  │          │                     │ from the document flow         │                             │
#  ├──────────┼─────────────────────┼────────────────────────────────┼─────────────────────────────┤
#  │ position │ fixed               │ Positioned relative to the     │ position: fixed; top: 0;    │
#  │          │                     │ browser viewport, removed from │ width: 100%;                │
#  │          │                     │ the document flow              │                             │
#  ├──────────┼─────────────────────┼────────────────────────────────┼─────────────────────────────┤
#  │ position │ sticky              │ Sticks to the given position   │ position: sticky; top:      │
#  │          │                     │ while scrolling                │ 10px;                       │
#  ├──────────┼─────────────────────┼────────────────────────────────┼─────────────────────────────┤
#  │ top      │ <length> |          │ Offset from the reference top  │ top: 20px;                  │
#  │          │ <percentage> | auto │ edge                           │ top: 20%;                   │
#  ├──────────┼─────────────────────┼────────────────────────────────┼─────────────────────────────┤
#  │ top      │ auto                │ Default, computed              │ top: auto;                  │
#  │          │                     │ automatically                  │                             │
#  ├──────────┼─────────────────────┼────────────────────────────────┼─────────────────────────────┤
#  │ right    │ <length> |          │ Offset from the reference      │ right: 30px;                │
#  │          │ <percentage> | auto │ right edge                     │ right: 20%;                 │
#  ├──────────┼─────────────────────┼────────────────────────────────┼─────────────────────────────┤
#  │ right    │ auto                │ Default, computed              │ right: auto;                │
#  │          │                     │ automatically                  │                             │
#  ├──────────┼─────────────────────┼────────────────────────────────┼─────────────────────────────┤
#  │ bottom   │ <length> |          │ Offset from the reference      │ bottom: 10px;               │
#  │          │ <percentage> | auto │ bottom edge                    │ bottom: 20%;                │
#  ├──────────┼─────────────────────┼────────────────────────────────┼─────────────────────────────┤
#  │ bottom   │ auto                │ Default, computed              │ bottom: auto;               │
#  │          │                     │ automatically                  │                             │
#  ├──────────┼─────────────────────┼────────────────────────────────┼─────────────────────────────┤
#  │ left     │ <length> |          │ Offset from the reference left │ left: 15px;                 │
#  │          │ <percentage> | auto │ edge                           │ left: 20%;                  │
#  ├──────────┼─────────────────────┼────────────────────────────────┼─────────────────────────────┤
#  │ left     │ auto                │ Default, computed              │ left: auto;                 │
#  │          │                     │ automatically                  │                             │
#  ├──────────┼─────────────────────┼────────────────────────────────┼─────────────────────────────┤
#  │ z-index  │ <integer>           │ Stacking level; larger values  │ z-index: 10;                │
#  │          │                     │ are in front                   │                             │
#  ├──────────┼─────────────────────┼────────────────────────────────┼─────────────────────────────┤
#  │ z-index  │ auto                │ Default, same stacking level   │ z-index: auto;              │
#  │          │                     │ as the parent                  │                             │
#  └──────────┴─────────────────────┴────────────────────────────────┴─────────────────────────────┘
#
#  Example 1: relative (relative positioning)
#
#    ┌──────────┐
#    │Normal 1  │
#    └──────────┘
#            ┌──────────┐
#            │Relative  │
#            └──────────┘
#    ┌──────────┐
#    │Normal 2  │
#    └──────────┘
#
#  Key config:
#  .box { position: relative; top: 20px; left: 30px; }
#
#  ---
#  Example 2: absolute (absolute positioning)
#
#  ┌──────────────────────────┐
#  │Parent           ┌─────┐  │
#  │                 │     │  │
#  │                 │Child│  │
#  │                 │     │  │
#  │                 └─────┘  │
#  └──────────────────────────┘
#
#  Key config:
#  .parent { position: relative; }
#  .child { position: absolute; top: 20px; right: 20px; }
#
#  ---
#  Example 3: fixed (fixed navbar)
#
#  ┌────────────────────────────────┐
#  │  Fixed navbar (doesn't scroll) │  ← always at the top of the viewport
#  ├────────────────────────────────┤
#  │  Page content                  │
#  │                                │
#  │  (scrolling area...)           │
#  └────────────────────────────────┘
#
#  Key config:
#  .navbar { position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; }
#  body { padding-top: 60px; }  /* leave room */
#
#  ---
#  Example 4: sticky (sticky positioning)
#
#  Before scrolling:  While scrolling:   After scrolling:
#  ┌───────────────┐ ┌───────────────┐  ┌───────────────┐
#  │Title 1        │ │Title 1 (fixed)│  │Title 2        │  ← Title 1 gets pushed up
#  ├───────────────┤ ├───────────────┤  ├───────────────┤
#  │Content 1...   │ │Content 2...   │  │Content 3...   │
#  │Content 2...   │ │               │  └───────────────┘
#  │               │ │Title 2        │
#  │Title 2        │ ├───────────────┤
#  ├───────────────┤ │Content 3...   │
#  │Content 3...   │ └───────────────┘
#  └───────────────┘
#
#  Key config:
#  .header { position: sticky; top: 0; }
#  .container { overflow-y: scroll; }  /* needs a scroll container */
#
#  ---
#  Example 5: absolute + transform (centered modal)
#
#  ┌────────────────────────────────┐
#  │                                │
#  │                    ┌────────┐  │
#  │                    │Modal   │  │  ← perfectly centered
#  │                    └────────┘  │
#  │                                │
#  └────────────────────────────────┘
#
#  Key config:
#  .modal {
#    position: fixed;
#    top: 50%;
#    left: 50%;
#    transform: translate(-50%, -50%);
#  }
#
#  ---
#  Example 6: absolute (text overlaid on an image)
#
#  ┌────────────────────────┐
#  │                        │
#  │       Image area       │
#  │                        │
#  ├────────────────────────┤
#  │   This is the caption  │  ← overlaid on the bottom of the image
#  └────────────────────────┘
#
#  Key config:
#  .container { position: relative; }
#  .caption {
#    position: absolute;
#    bottom: 0;
#    left: 0;
#    right: 0;
#  }
#
#  ---
#  Example 7: fixed (back-to-top button)
#
#  ┌────────────────────────────────┐
#  │                                │
#  │  Page content                  │
#  │                                │
#  │                        ┌──┐    │
#  │                        │↑ │    │  ← always in the bottom-right corner
#  │                        └──┘    │
#  └────────────────────────────────┘
#
#  Key config:
#  .back-top {
#    position: fixed;
#    bottom: 20px;
#    right: 20px;
#  }
#
#  ---
#  Example 8: z-index (stacking)
#
#      ┌─────┐
#      │  3  │  ← z-index: 3 (topmost)
#      ├─────┤
#    ┌─────┐
#    │  2  │    ← z-index: 2
#    ├─────┤
#  ┌─────┐
#  │  1  │      ← z-index: 1 (bottommost)
#  └─────┘
#
#  Key config:
#  .box { position: absolute; }
#  .box1 { z-index: 1; }
#  .box2 { z-index: 2; }
#  .box3 { z-index: 3; }
#
#
# ## display: flex (flexbox layout)
# 
# Lays out child elements along the main axis (row by default); the default alignment looks like
# this
# ┌──────────────────────────────────────────────┐
# │  container { display: flex; }                │
# │                                      │       │
# │  ┌────┐  ┌────┐  ┌────┐  ┌────┐      │       │
# │  │ 1  │  │ 2  │  │ 3  │  │ 4  │      │ cross │
# │  └────┘  └────┘  └────┘  └────┘      │ axis  │
# │                                      │       │
# │  ←─────── main axis (row) ───────→   │       │
# │                                      │       │
# └──────────────────────────────────────────────┘
# 
# Container properties
#  ┌─────────────────┬──────────────────────────────────────┬──────────────────────────────────────┐
#  │ Property        │ Effect                               │ Common values                        │
#  ├─────────────────┼──────────────────────────────────────┼──────────────────────────────────────┤
#  │ flex-direction  │ Main axis direction                  │ row (horizontal) / column (vertical) │
#  ├─────────────────┼──────────────────────────────────────┼──────────────────────────────────────┤
#  │ flex-wrap       │ Wrapping                             │ nowrap / wrap                        │
#  ├─────────────────┼──────────────────────────────────────┼──────────────────────────────────────┤
#  │ justify-content │ Main axis alignment                  │ center / space-between / flex-start  │
#  ├─────────────────┼──────────────────────────────────────┼──────────────────────────────────────┤
#  │ align-items     │ Cross axis alignment                 │ center / stretch / flex-start        │
#  │                 │ (the axis perpendicular to the main  │                                      │
#  │                 │ axis)                                │                                      │
#  ├─────────────────┼──────────────────────────────────────┼──────────────────────────────────────┤
#  │ gap             │ Spacing                              │ 10px / 20px                          │
#  └─────────────────┴──────────────────────────────────────┴──────────────────────────────────────┘
#  Item properties
#  ┌─────────────┬────────────────────────────────────────┬────────────────────────────────────────┐
#  │ Property    │ Effect                                 │ Common values                          │
#  ├─────────────┼────────────────────────────────────────┼────────────────────────────────────────┤
#  │ flex        │ Shorthand for the flex-* properties    │ flex: flex-grow flex-shrink flex-basis │
#  ├─────────────┼────────────────────────────────────────┼────────────────────────────────────────┤
#  │ flex-grow   │ Grow factor (applies when there is     │ 1 / 0                                  │
#  │             │ spare space)                           │                                        │
#  ├─────────────┼────────────────────────────────────────┼────────────────────────────────────────┤
#  │ flex-shrink │ Shrink factor (applies when space is   │ 1 / 0                                  │
#  │             │ short)                                 │                                        │
#  ├─────────────┼────────────────────────────────────────┼────────────────────────────────────────┤
#  │ flex-basis  │ Initial size                           │ auto / 200px                           │
#  ├─────────────┼────────────────────────────────────────┼────────────────────────────────────────┤
#  │ order       │ Ordering, ascending; default 0 shows   │ integer                                │
#  │             │ in source order                        │                                        │
#  ├─────────────┼────────────────────────────────────────┼────────────────────────────────────────┤
#  │ align-self  │ Per-item alignment, same effect as     │ center / flex-start                    │
#  │             │ align-items                            │                                        │
#  │             │ but not passed down to children        │                                        │
#  └─────────────┴────────────────────────────────────────┴────────────────────────────────────────┘
#
# The alignment options
# justify-content (main axis alignment)
#
# flex-start (left)   center (centered)    flex-end (right)
# ┌──────────┐        ┌──────────┐         ┌──────────┐
# │123       │        │   123    │         │       123│
# └──────────┘        └──────────┘         └──────────┘
#
# space-between               space-around               space-evenly
# ┌───────┐                   ┌─────────┐               ┌───────────┐
# │1  2  3│                   │ 1  2  3 │               │  1  2  3  │
# └───────┘                   └─────────┘               └───────────┘
# no space at the ends,       ends get 1/2 space,       all spaces equal,
# equal space between         between gets 1 space      including the ends
#
# align-items (cross axis alignment, perpendicular to the main axis; flex-direction=row as the
# example)
#
# align-items: start                align-items: center              align-items: end
#   ┌──────────┐                     ┌──────────┐                     ┌──────────┐
#   │1  2      │                     │          │                     │          │
#   │          │                     │1  2      │                     │          │
#   │3         │                     │3         │                     │1  2      │
#   │          │                     │          │                     │          │
#   └──────────┘                     └──────────┘                     │3         │
#   aligned to top                   centered                         └──────────┘
#                                                                     aligned to bottom
#   all items align to the           all items are centered           all items align to the
#   start of the cross axis          on the cross axis                end of the cross axis
#
#   align-items: stretch
#   ┌──────────┐
#   │          │
#   │1    2    │
#   │          │
#   │3         │
#   └──────────┘
#   stretched to fill
#   all items are stretched to the container's height
#
#  ╔══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════╗
#  ║                 Total container size: 1400px × 800px                         ║
